  "Hello! I'm analyzing **XAUUSD** on **M5**. Market structure shows a bullish momentum retest at the lower EDT channel line ($2,634.50).": "Halo! Saya sedang menganalisis **XAUUSD** pada **M5**. Struktur pasar menunjukkan uji ulang momentum bullish di garis kanal EDT bawah ($2,634.50).",
  "What is the current M5 SSA trend & EDT channel situation for XAUUSD?": "Bagaimana tren SSA M5 dan kondisi kanal EDT XAUUSD saat ini?",
